      "message": "Yeah, that was my motivation... I wanted to make it possible to override it if you absolutely wanted to, but not encourage it as I wanted the interface (the flag) to communicate that the intention is to have consistent build paths. By making it an env var, I was trying to suggest that if you change it, it should be changed for all invocations, not per workspace.",
